\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces RCDP architecture. Every window passes the frozen primary detector (2) and confidence gate (3); confident windows are decided directly (3a). Only windows with $\tau _{\mathrm  {low}}<p<\tau _{\mathrm  {high}}$ enter the deliberative path: evidence serialisation (3b), case retrieval (3c), local reasoning (3d), optional contrastive critique that may refine severity, action and rationale but never the label (3e), and a simulated action policy (4). The footer lists the ablation modes of Table\nobreakspace  {}\ref  {tab:ablationmean}; \texttt  {gate\_knn} and \texttt  {gate\_llm} each add one component to \texttt  {gate\_only}.}}{4}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:arch}{{1}{4}{RCDP architecture. Every window passes the frozen primary detector (2) and confidence gate (3); confident windows are decided directly (3a). Only windows with $\tau _{\mathrm {low}}<p<\tau _{\mathrm {high}}$ enter the deliberative path: evidence serialisation (3b), case retrieval (3c), local reasoning (3d), optional contrastive critique that may refine severity, action and rationale but never the label (3e), and a simulated action policy (4). The footer lists the ablation modes of Table~\ref {tab:ablationmean}; \texttt {gate\_knn} and \texttt {gate\_llm} each add one component to \texttt {gate\_only}}{figure.1}{}}
